window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>When curvy witch Romi Weir buys the beloved Witch's Brew Café in her enchanted hometown of Mystic Hollow, she's ready to whip up some magic and mend the rift between witches and shifters.</b></p> <p>What she doesn't expect is a side order of sabotage—or a cool, mouth-watering wolf shifter whose protective nature has Romi weak at the knees!</p> <p>Xabir Lupo is no stranger to handling corporate threats, but when an explosive dark curse nearly takes down Romi, his fierce loyalty ignites a passion neither can ignore. As Romi's café turns into a battleground of wild magic and sabotage, Xabir has his hands full with a fiery witch who's as stubborn as she is sweet, and enemies who want to destroy everything she's built.</p> <p>Between steamy kitchen showdowns, daring duels against dark magic, and community chaos at the Mystic Market Food Fair, Romi finds herself falling hard for the alpha who not only defends her but makes her believe in a future filled with unity and love. Can a fearless witch and a protective wolf shifter transform rivalry into romance—and just how many magical disasters can one café handle before these two admit they're perfect for each other?</p> <p><i>Get ready for a sizzling tale where magic meets muscle, and where true love might just be the secret ingredient to unite two worlds!</i></p>"; 
